   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482936781000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3NS9gXX98-cVgqWaZuc5KW\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s320/Rplot.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"218\"></a></p>How do you make a legend for nodepies?<div><br></div><div>From the vignette:</div><div>```</div><div><div>set.seed(2015-12-31)</div><div>tr &lt;- rtree(15)</div><div>p &lt;- ggtree(tr)</div><div><br></div><div>a &lt;- runif(14, 0, 0.33)</div><div>b &lt;- runif(14, 0, 0.33)</div><div>c &lt;- runif(14, 0, 0.33)</div><div>d &lt;- 1 - a - b - c</div><div>dat &lt;- data.frame(a=a, b=b, c=c, d=d)</div><div>## input data should have a column of `node` that store the node number</div><div>dat$node &lt;- 15+1:14</div><div><br></div><div>pies &lt;- nodepie(dat, cols=1:4, alpha=.6)</div><div>inset(p, pies)</div></div><div>```</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482936781000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3NS9gXX98-cVgqWaZuc5KW\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s320/Rplot.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"218\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">I am making several trees with upwards of 10 + labels each so doing it by hand is not feasible. Any ideas appreciated!</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
