     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I cannot replicate the code posted by Tyler. One of his data sources no longer exists. In looking at the code I can see that he essentially makes a dummy bar chart for the legend (pasted below). However, his pies were made in a different manner than `nodepie`. Thus, without seeing the structure of his data I am having trouble identifying what variables are what in the e1 plot. Any idea? <div><br></div><div><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">e1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> ggplot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">race_data_long</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">[[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">]],</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> prop</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> fill</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">race</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n        geom_bar</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">stat</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;identity&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> width</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> \r\n        coord_polar</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">theta</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;y&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> \r\n\r\nleg1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> gtable_filter</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">ggplot_gtable</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">ggplot_build</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">e1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;guide-box&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> \r\n\r\n\r\np </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> ggplot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">ny</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">long</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> lat</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> group</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">group</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">  \r\n    geom_polygon</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">colour</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&#39;black&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> fill</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">NA</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n    theme_bw</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n    annotation_custom</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">grob </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> leg1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> xmin </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">-77.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> xmax </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">-78.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> ymin </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">44</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> ymax </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">45</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span></code></pre><span><br>On Tuesday, July 26, 2016 at 12:43:47 PM UTC-5, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gc...@connect.hku.hk</a> wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">see the code posted by Tyler, <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/10368180/plotting-pie-graphs-on-map-in-ggplot\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/10368180/plotting-pie-graphs-on-map-in-ggplot&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482936796000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dm5oXOY68XTqKlGUX5Ri3\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/10368180/plotting-pie-graphs-on-map-in-ggplot</a><br><br>On Wednesday, July 27, 2016 at 1:01:19 AM UTC+8, Mary O&#39;Neill wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482936796000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Bf8NnIqD_AuZ0LEcjMt9l\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s320/Rplot.png\" height=\"218\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\"></a></p>How do you make a legend for nodepies?<div><br></div><div>From the vignette:</div><div>```</div><div><div>set.seed(2015-12-31)</div><div>tr &lt;- rtree(15)</div><div>p &lt;- ggtree(tr)</div><div><br></div><div>a &lt;- runif(14, 0, 0.33)</div><div>b &lt;- runif(14, 0, 0.33)</div><div>c &lt;- runif(14, 0, 0.33)</div><div>d &lt;- 1 - a - b - c</div><div>dat &lt;- data.frame(a=a, b=b, c=c, d=d)</div><div>## input data should have a column of `node` that store the node number</div><div>dat$node &lt;- 15+1:14</div><div><br></div><div>pies &lt;- nodepie(dat, cols=1:4, alpha=.6)</div><div>inset(p, pies)</div></div><div>```</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482936796000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Bf8NnIqD_AuZ0LEcjMt9l\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5Gs0xSxWhHQ/V5eW0fhUwkI/AAAAAAAAFvg/45CvtA1bBpgjFRN262r_aivP50gYOdZDACLcB/s320/Rplot.png\" height=\"218\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">I am making several trees with upwards of 10 + labels each so doing it by hand is not feasible. Any ideas appreciated!</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></span></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
